ocean|sea|NOUN|Vast body of salt water|One of the Earth's largest connected bodies of salt water.|đại dương|The ship crossed the ocean in rough weather.|Con tàu vượt đại dương trong thời tiết xấu.|Countable division; the ocean collectively.|0
